---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy — Growtick Academy" description="Growtick Academy privacy policy: how we handle your registration and certificate data.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:44rem;">
      <p class="overline">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">Growtick Academy (academy.growtick.in) is operated by Growtick. This policy covers the offline GST batch and academy services.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you register for an offline batch we collect your name, email address and mobile number, plus your registration code. When you sign in, Supabase Auth stores your email. Certificates include your name, course and a verification code. We do not collect payment card details — offline batches are pay on arrival.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>To administer your batch registration, send your confirmation and certificate emails (via Resend from academy@growtick.in), mark attendance at the venue, and let anyone verify your certificate at /verify.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>A theme preference (light/dark) is stored in your browser’s localStorage. If you sign in, Supabase sets a session cookie. No tracking or advertising cookies are used.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data by messaging us on WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/919513059059">+91 95130 59059</a>.</p>

      <p style="margin-top:2rem; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem;">© Growtick. <a href="https://growtick.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">growtick.in</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
